  "notes": "Used specifically for making up for damages or losses.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{補償|ほしょう}する (to compensate)\n・{補償|ほしょう}{金|きん} (compensation money)\n・{損害|そんがい}{補償|ほしょう} (damage compensation)\n・{補償|ほしょう}{制度|せいど} (compensation system)\n・{被害|ひがい}{補償|ほしょう} (victim compensation)\n\nHOMOPHONES (all ほしょう):\n・{保証|ほしょう} - guarantee (for products, promises)\n・{保障|ほしょう} - security, protection (for rights, systems)\n・{補償|ほしょう} - compensation (for damages)\n\nMEMORY TIP:\n{補償|ほしょう} uses {補|ほ} (supplement/compensate) - filling in what was lost",
